    "model.usage": {
      "version": 2,
      "seat_scoped": true,
      "doc": "Append-only per-call fact. usage_key is stable across correction events and scoped by producer + binding. Numeric usage.cost.total and producer-provided SHA strings are NOT authority. Provider receipts and pricing must match content-addressed approved records in the trusted registry cost_authorities (empty by default: no billed/pricing evidence configured). Provider records bind producer/binding/call/provider/model/amount; catalog records bind provider/model/rates. v1 replay is conserved using legacy:<event_id>, an immutable event identity, NOT a claimed shared provider-call identity. Historical unproven costs/reasoning remain raw facts but are NULL/unknown in model_usage_current. Corrections never rewrite originals.",
