      "doc": "The nightly store backup reporting itself (CC11 bead ompkit-fp72.120.16.15.6): one envelope per completed backup pass, emitted after run_backup commits, never under --replay. backup_ok (1 when the copy verified, else 0); backup_bytes (bytes of the verified copy, 0 when skipped or corrupt); integrity ('ok' or a fixed code: CORRUPT, BACKUP_DISK_FLOOR). A separate type (not cc.self fields) so the cc.self all-fields-numeric gate (15.10) holds.",
